    # NUMA @ think "I remember him being particularly interested in texts about dreams and dark magecraft."
    NUMA @ think "Я помню, он очень был заинтересован текстами про сны и тёмное колдовство."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:270
