translate ru qst_dreamhouse_l5_gator_counter_809f4890:

    # "As it dragged another member of my party beneath the black water with a splash, I waited for something... anything... to resurface."
    "Когда оно с плеском утащило под воду еще одного члена моей группы, я чего-то ждал... хоть что-нибудь... что всплывет на поверхность."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2400
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_l5_gator_counter_2ae5d1be:

    # "... But nothing came."
    "... Но ничего не произошло."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2402
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_l5_gator_counter_b00e6915:

    # MC @ surprised "Where did they go?!"
    MC @ surprised "Куда они пропали?!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2403
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_l5_gator_counter_7961cb75:

    # "The black water calmed as it rippled softly... And then there was silence."
    "Чёрная вода успокоилась, слегка рябя... А затем, наступила тишина."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2413
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_88a79f84:

    # "This time, as we pushed through the doorway, we found ourselves, for the first time, not looping back to the entrance hallway,"
    "На этот раз, когда мы протиснулись в дверной проем, то впервые обнаружили, что уже не возвращаемся в прихожую,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2414
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_8a10ab7f:

    # "but within the master bedroom itself at last... Or at least,"
    "а оказались наконец в главной спальне... Или по крайней мере,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2415
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_7a3da93b:

    # "what I thought was supposed to be the master bedroom."
    "то, что как я думал, должно было быть главной спальней."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2416
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_bdc04444:

    # "Looking behind me, I could see everyone was back—dazed and confused, perhaps—but... alive and present."
    "Оглянувшись, я увидел что все вернулись, немного ошеломлённые и растерянные, но... живые и присутствующие."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2420
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_8c5e33ae:

    # "A blonde girl turned to face me as I entered. Stood stoically behind her, an elderly mage watched."
    "Светловолосая девушка повернулась ко мне когда я вошел. За ее спиной стоял невозмутимый пожилой маг, и наблюдал."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2421
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_6a42290d:

    # VIRGO "Ah, good, you made it through."
    VIRGO "Ах, хорошо, вы всё-таки прорвались."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2422
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_0ba9a927:

    # SERAFINA @ shock "You..."
    SERAFINA @ shock "Ты..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2423
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_c9936f06:

    # SERAFINA @ shock "You're the one from my dreams!"
    SERAFINA @ shock "Ты тот самый из моих снов!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2424
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_bde6c2b6:

    # MC @ think "What?"
    MC @ think "Чего?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2425
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_d04f2520:

    # VIRGO "Where is Davik? Did he send for you?"
    VIRGO "Где Дэйвик? Он же вас послал?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2426
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_ab371a2b:

    # MC @ talk "No, we were sent here by the girl's mothers."
    MC @ talk "Нет, нас послали сюда матери девочки."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2427
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_089a5c83:

    # "I raised a brow at the youthful face in front of me."
    "Я удивлённо приподнял бровь, глядя на юное лицо перед собой."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2428
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_f858472b:

    # MC @ think "You're Serafina, I take it?"
    MC @ think "Ты ведь Серафина, я правильно понимаю?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2429
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_bc9fad83:

    # "The girl nodded."
    "Девушка кивнула."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2430
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_92966b94:

    # SERAFINA @ sad "Where is father?"
    SERAFINA @ sad "А где папа?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2431
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_94af89f6:

    # SERAFINA @ sad "He went back through the house to gather supplies."
    SERAFINA @ sad "Он забежал обратно в дом, чтобы собрать припасы."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2432
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_4a3076d3:

    # SERAFINA @ scared "We need him back before {i}it{/i} comes!"
    SERAFINA @ scared "Нам нужно чтобы он вернулся, пока {i}оно{/i} не явилось!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2433
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_cbeb8405:

    # MC @ think "{i}It?{/i}"
    MC @ think "{i}Оно?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2434
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_ce9d8fbd:

    # VIRGO "This house was designed for containment."
    VIRGO "Этот дом был создан для сдерживания."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2435
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_e39f9a4f:

    # VIRGO "A place to store and contain her nightmares..."
    VIRGO "Место, чтобы хранить и сдерживать её кошмары..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2436
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_b5e226e9:

    # VIRGO "And hopefully, to gain mastery of her powers."
    VIRGO "И будем надеяться, чтобы она обрела власть над своими силами."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2437
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_00884ec5:

    # SYPHA @ talk "You still haven't answered what {i}it{/i} is."
    SYPHA @ talk "Ты так и не ответил, что такое {i}оно{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2438
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_31ab88d3:

    # "Around us, the world seems to bend and crackle, as {i}something{/i} fights its way through."
    "Вокруг нас мир словно изгибался и трещал, пока {i}что-то{/i} пробивалось сквозь него."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2439
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_fc91cc92:

    # "Serafina's eyes glow purple, bleeding tears streaming down her face as she clutches her head, teeth gritted in pain."
    "Глаза Серафины засветились фиолетовым, по лицу её текли кровавые слёзы, она схватилась за голову, стиснув зубы от боли."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2448
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_9bf78591:

    # SERAFINA @ scared "I can't hold it back much longer!"
    SERAFINA @ scared "Я больше не могу его сдерживать!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2441
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_91568ef1:

    # VIRGO "The heart of her fears—it has manifested itself as this creature."
    VIRGO "Сердце её страхов — оно воплотилось в это существо."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2442
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_5e22b05c:

    # VIRGO "And it refuses to stay a prisoner here."
    VIRGO "И оно отказывается оставаться здесь в плену."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2443
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_7e1a7dc2:

    # "The sky ripples and tears as the creature begins to force its way into this reality."
    "Небо колыхнулось и разорвалось, когда существо начало прорываться в эту реальность."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2444
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_d233aee6:

    # MC @ serious "What do we do?"
    MC @ serious "Что нам делать?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2445
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_1b4a865c:

    # "With a tap of his staff, I felt a surge of energy rush through me!"
    "Одним ударом посоха он вызвал мощный прилив энергии, прошедший сквозь меня!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2448
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_c3bcd573:

    # VIRGO "Damn it... It seems we can wait no longer for your father, Serafina."
    VIRGO "Проклятье... Видимо больше ждать твоего отца мы не можем, Серафина."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2449
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_400ef679:

    # "The dark mage motioned to all of us."
    "Тёмный маг жестом указал на всех нас."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2450
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_969edbea:

    # VIRGO "You hold the creature back!"
    VIRGO "Вы, сдерживайте существо!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2451
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_997a7bc7:

    # VIRGO "{i}I'll seal the rift...{/i}"
    VIRGO "{i}А я запечатаю разлом...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2452
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_452972d0:

    # MARKUS @ scared "That's..."
    MARKUS @ scared "Оно..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2453
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_660c9d06:

    # MARKUS @ scared "{i}big.{/i}"
    MARKUS @ scared "{i}огромное.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2454
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_cfccf33a:

    # "Kiara and Sypha readied themselves."
    "Киара и Сифа приготовились."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2455
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_8cf086f6:

    # SYPHA @ angry "The power radiating from that thing... This won't be easy!"
    SYPHA @ angry "Сила, исходящая от этой твари... Это будет непросто!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2457
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_a81fe26e:

    # "Ves tightened her hands around her axe."
    "Вес крепче сжала топор в своих руках."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2458
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_998e5eb8:

    # VES @ angry "Let it come!"
    VES @ angry "Пусть идёт!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2459
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_3814d0d1:

    # "The sky ripped open, revealing a black void behind it."
    "Небо разорвалось, обнажив за собой чёрную пустоту."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2460
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_3ce9111e:

    # "Two great, pale hands reached through as the creature's head pushed through the darkness,"
    "Две огромные, бледные руки протянулись сквозь разрыв, а следом протиснулась голова существа,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2461
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_43dd8aa1:

    # "scowling at us as it opened its mouth to roar!"
    "оно злобно уставилось на нас и раскрыло пасть в рёве!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2465
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_6d447bc0:

    # MC @ surprised "Here we go!"
    MC @ surprised "Ну началась!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2466
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_786f0070:

    # MC @ angry "ALL AT ONCE!"
    MC @ angry "ВСЕ ВМЕСТЕ!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2473
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_cd8088ca:

    # VIRGO "NOW!"
    VIRGO "СЕЙЧАС!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2475
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_d1be9a81:

    # "The nightmare creature retreated, pushed back into the darkness from which it tore through."
    "Кошмарное существо отступило, оттеснённое обратно в темноту, из которой оно прорвалось."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2486
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_e78b915d:

    # "With trembling hands, Virgo's body was pushed to its aboslute limits, the veins in his arms and temples seeming ready to burst at any moment,"
    "С дрожащими руками, Вирго доводил свое тело до полного предела, вены на его руках и на висках казалось были готовы лопнуть в любой момент,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2477
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_c9ab07b2:

    # "the great tear was slowly sealed shut, until at last, it was gone."
    "он медленно запечатал огромный разрыв, пока тот наконец не исчез."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2478
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_9d720c32:

    # "Dropping to his knees breathlessly, he looked up towards us."
    "Обессиленно упав на колени, он поднял на нас взгляд."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2479
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_c1696d9b:

    # VIRGO "Thank you... Your assistance was..."
    VIRGO "Спасибо... Ваша помощь была..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2480
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_86502b92:

    # VIRGO "welcomed."
    VIRGO "весьма кстати."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2481
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_8599621e:

    # "No sooner had he finished than Davik appeared through the doorway."
    "Не успел он договорить, как через дверной проём появился Дэйвик."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2482
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_fa694f5d:

    # DAVIK "Serafina! SERAFINA!"
    DAVIK "Серафина! СЕРАФИНА!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2497
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_1f482d17:

    # SERAFINA @ smile "Father!"
    SERAFINA @ smile "Папа!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2484
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_af99b283:

    # DAVIK "Are you alright, girl?"
    DAVIK "Ты в порядке, девочка моя?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2485
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_1e866a89:

    # DAVIK "What happened?"
    DAVIK "Что произошло?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2486
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_8b371310:

    # SERAFINA @ smile "It's alright... Father."
    SERAFINA @ smile "Всё хорошо... Пап."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2487
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_b6d8e9f9:

    # SERAFINA @ smile "We did it, we sealed it away!"
    SERAFINA @ smile "Мы справились, мы запечатали его!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2488
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_6c3e818e:

    # DAVIK "Thank the gods..."
    DAVIK "Слава богам..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2505
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_cfd08e31:

    # "Davik turned towards me."
    "Дэйвик повернулся ко мне."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2490
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_33c95ccd:

    # DAVIK "You have my eternal thanks for helping save my daughter."
    DAVIK "Я вечно буду благодарен вам за то, что помогли спасти мою дочь."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2491
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_c7d70e1d:

    # DAVIK "Come, Serafina, let's go..."
    DAVIK "Пойдём, Серафина, нам пора..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2492
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_e9b40ebe:

    # MC @ think "Wait, hold for a moment."
    MC @ think "Постой, погоди минутку."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2493
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_3f368aa9:

    # MC @ talk "I've been ordered to bring Serafina back to her mother."
    MC @ talk "Мне приказали вернуть Серафину к её матери."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2494
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_3553ec16:

    # DAVIK "You must think me a fool to just hand her back over!"
    DAVIK "Ты должно быть считаешь меня идиотом, раз я просто отдам её обратно!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2495
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_33a83dce:

    # DAVIK "Not after all these years!"
    DAVIK "Уж не после стольких лет!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2496
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_f6b52ec0:

    # VIRGO "WAIT!"
    VIRGO "ПОДОЖДИТЕ!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2497
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_7d375837:

    # VIRGO "Both of you..."
    VIRGO "Вы оба..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2498
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_2e1f113b:

    # "Slowly, the dark mage rose back to his feet."
    "Тёмный маг медленно поднялся на ноги."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2521
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_39f0c626:

    # VIRGO "Bring the girl back to her mothers and let me take the girl as an apprentice."
    VIRGO "Верни девочку назад к её матерям, и позволь мне взять её к себе в ученицы."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2500
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_56420d6a:

    # DAVIK "ARE YOU INSANE?"
    DAVIK "ТЫ В СВОЁМ УМЕ?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2501
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_28cb88a0:

    # DAVIK "Your vile services were hired just to help me protect MY daughter!"
    DAVIK "Твои мерзкие услуги были наняты лишь для того, чтобы помочь мне защитить МОЮ дочь!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2502
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_d926361c:

    # DAVIK "I'm an inquisitor! You really think I'm going to let a fucking dark mage tutor her?"
    DAVIK "Я инквизитор! Ты серьёзно думаешь, что я позволю какому-то чёртовому тёмному магу обучать её?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:2503
translate ru qst_dreamhouse_final_housescene_f101a247:

    # DAVIK "No! She will come back with me to Novaras. There, she will learn under the Inquisition."
